job-name-scp049 = SCP-049 "The Plague Doctor"
job-description-scp049 = A mysterious humanoid in a robe who believes he is a doctor. His touch is lethal, and his goal is to "cure" humanity.
job-name-scp106 = SCP-106 "The Old Man"
job-description-scp106 = An old, decaying monster that appears from corrosive portals. It stalks victims with sadistic cruelty.
job-name-scp939 = SCP-939 "With Many Voices"
job-description-scp939 = Predatory eyeless creatures that lure prey with the voices of previous victims. Perfect for covert attacks in the dark.
job-name-scp082 = SCP-082 "Fernand the Cannibal"
job-description-scp082 = A giant with refined manners and a taste for human flesh. He likes to tell stories before setting a feast.
job-name-scp096 = SCP-096 "Shy Guy"
job-description-scp096 = An extremely dangerous creature that reacts to being seen. If someone sees its face, nothing can save the victim.
job-name-scp999 = SCP-999 "The Tickling Monster"
job-description-scp999 = A friendly, amoeboid entity that induces endless joy and laughter. It can relieve stress and heal depression.
job-name-scp173 = SCP-173 "The Sculpture"
job-description-scp173 = A sculpture that kills when visual contact is broken. Fast, silent, and lethal if you blink.
job-name-scp131 = SCP-131 "The Eyeballs"
job-description-scp131 = Small harmless mechanical entities with a single prominent eye.


